<title>USA: Fluor Corp unit buys staffing group.</title>
<headline>Fluor Corp unit buys staffing group.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>TRS Staffing Solutions Inc, a unit of Fluor Corp's principal subsidiary, said Monday it acquired ConSol group, which comprises Contract Solutions, Corico Recruiters and Core Medical Group. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The Salem, New Hampshire-based companies provide personnel in the fields of information technology and allied health, TRS said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
